2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Each app lives in its own repository, with its history carried over.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Three apps with separate Fly deploy targets shared one monorepo checkout, one `scripts/ci.sh` building all three, and one self-hosted deploy script.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Check a deploy against the `/opt/weftspun/<repo>/` convention, one directory per repo, before you run it. The sections below hold the path changes and open follow-up work.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Split apps/ into their own repos
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Each app moved to its own repository, with history preserved by `git subtree split --prefix=apps/<app>`, then pushed as that repo's `main`: `weftspun/weftspun-studio`, `weftspun/weftspun-character-taxonomy`, and `weftspun/weftspun-usd-viewer`. `deploy/`, `.github/workflows/deploy-fly.yml`, and `scripts/deploy-weftspun-quadlet.sh` moved into `weftspun-studio`, the one app that requires the other two reachable. `thirdparty/3d_studio/` and `thirdparty/android-xr-face-bridge/` moved to `weftspun-3d-studio`'s own repo root, leaving that repo the browser client and the companion APK only.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1120) 'RFD66606-1058 gives the Quadlet deploy this split's `deploy/` move adapts. RFD66606-1060 and RFD66606-1076 give the repo-layout history this RFD continues.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

