2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1120) '`git subtree split --prefix=apps/<app>` only carries history for commits where that content already lived under `apps/<app>/`. Each new repo's history starts at RFD66606-1076's move into `apps/`, not the project's full history; the fuller history stays in `weftspun-3d-studio`'s own git log.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1120) 'The `/opt/weftspun/<repo>/` convention
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-1120) 'The self-hosted Quadlet deploy (RFD66606-1058) used to `rsync` one monorepo checkout to `/opt/weftspun/src`, and every `.build` unit's `File=` path pointed inside it. With three repos, `weftspun-studio`'s own `scripts/deploy-weftspun-quadlet.sh` now:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1120) '1. Syncs itself to `/opt/weftspun/weftspun-studio` (an `rsync` of the working copy, as before).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1120) '2. Clones or `git pull --ff-only`s `weftspun/weftspun-usd-viewer` directly from GitHub to `/opt/weftspun/weftspun-usd-viewer`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-1120) '3. Installs `weftspun.network` (from `weftspun-studio`'s own `deploy/quadlet/`) plus every `.build`/`.container`/`.volume` unit found under either app's own `deploy/quadlet/`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Each `.build` unit's `File=` path now reads `/opt/weftspun/<repo-name>/...`, one directory per repo instead of one path inside a monorepo. `character_taxonomy` needs no quadlet entry here; it deploys to Fly alone, with no self-hosted or cross-app dependency.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Removed, not moved
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-1120) '`apps/`, `scripts/ci.sh`, and `scripts/studio-test.sh` were removed from `weftspun-3d-studio`, since none apply to a repo with no app code left.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-1120) '- `scripts/ci.sh`: built the JS suite, the Elixir suite, and both container images from one checkout. No longer applies with three separate repos.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-1120) '- `scripts/studio-test.sh`, and its `.pre-commit-config.yaml` hook: ran `weftspun_studio`'s own `mix test`. Removed from `weftspun-3d-studio` along with the last hook that file had; each split repo needs its own CI, not yet built.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-1120) '- `scripts/push_gallery_to_vgw.exs`: pushed proof assets to versitygw's S3 API. Already dead before this split, since RFD66606-1079 removed versitygw.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Open work
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-1120) 'Each split repo needs its own CI (JS test and build for `weftspun-usd-viewer`, `mix test` for `weftspun-studio` and `weftspun-character-taxonomy`), not yet built. The self-hosted Quadlet deploy script is updated but not re-run against a live host since this split; a first run after this change should be treated as a fresh deploy, not an incremental one.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-1120) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-1120) '`weftspun-3d-studio` held three independently deployed apps (`weftspun_studio`, `character_taxonomy`, `usd_viewer_app`) under one `apps/` directory (RFD66606-1076), plus a large vendored browser client and a companion APK under `thirdparty/`. The three apps had no code sharing between them.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1120  1 LINE
 Text:Written
